after:
```swift
func seats(_ text: String) -> Int {
    guard let number = Int(text) else {
        return 0
    }
    guard number >= 1 && number <= 8 else {
        return 0
    }
    return number
}
print(seats("4"))
print(seats("many"))
```
The outputs are `4` and `0`. The text `4` becomes an allowed number. The text `many` cannot become an Int, so the function leaves early.
